OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy  
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain across the      
OL,7,Fwest, extending into Hampshire and     
OL,8,FSussex. Sunnier for most places by     
OL,9,FMonday. Cloudier once more, with rain  
OL,10,Fmaking eastward progress by Tuesday.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
